# Copy to ~/vigie/api.env on the server (deploy.sh files does it once, then leaves it alone).
# Settings of the API: "Configuration" in the README of the API.
# MET Norway and NOAA ask for an identifying contact in the User-Agent: an e-mail address or a URL they can open.
# The owner chooses it (the site's public address once the domain exists); empty until then.
# VIGIE_CONTACT=
